    "q-176866": {
      "dom_id": "step-q176866",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "$9$ is divisible by $4$, or $8$ is **not** divisible by $3.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:9\\text{ is divisible by }4$\n\n- $Q:8\\text{ is divisible by }3$",
      "worked_solution": "The sentence\n\n$9$ is divisible by $4$ \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $P.$ \n\nThe sentence\n\n$8$ is **not** divisible by $3$\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬Q.$\n\nTherefore, the sentence\n\n$9$ is divisible by $4$, or $8$ is **not** divisible by $3$\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $P∨¬Q.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
