    "q-176871": {
      "dom_id": "step-q176871",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "Simplify the statement $¬(¬P)∨¬(¬(P∧Q)).$",
      "worked_solution": "Two negations in a row cancel each other out. So: \n\n- we can simplify $¬(¬P)$ to $P,$ and\n\n- we can also simplify $¬(¬(P∧Q))$ to $P∧Q.$\n\nTherefore, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\nP∨(P∧Q).\n$$",
